  note "S4's pinned twin (cases 1.4.0, G2 Q-1): the judge's pinned asks of tmp/session7b/blind-run/judge/S4check/s4_pinned.tally, copied unchanged, run with s4.tally unchanged; the court's ruling on the will's reason pinned by with (L §5.18). Keys: engine/tests/cases/keys/S4/S4-03P.md, S4-04P.md; Ruta on 2027-12-31 as known 2028-01-01 (j5), S4-04P step 13; since tally 2.1.7 (E §11 REQ-CLOCK, #112; P36) j5 asks as known 2027-12-31, the model's on (no version is known after it), and its old form is the REQ-CLOCK twin m1/fixes/r5/s4_clock/."

